# Title: Suspicious Login Activity Classified By Google
# ID: 38360161-76c4-4283-842e-efcf997dafc8
# Status: experimental
# Level: medium
# Author: Tom Kluter
# Date: 2026-04-28
# Tags: attack.initial-access, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.stealth, attack.t1078.004
# Description: Detects Google Workspace login activity that's classified as suspicious by Google.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(protoPayload.serviceName equals "login.googleapis.com" AND (protoPayload.metadata.event.eventName equals "suspicious_login_less_secure_app" OR protoPayload.metadata.event.eventName equals "suspicious_login" OR protoPayload.metadata.event.eventName equals "suspicious_programmatic_login"))
